1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,667
The clinic smells like soap and old
coffee. A doctor in teal scrubs
listens to your chest.

2
00:00:06,367 --> 00:00:08,400
That wheeze isn't a cold. Asthma?

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:14,967
Since I was nine. The inhaler is
almost empty. I was thinking about
hiding it. Honestly.

4
00:00:15,667 --> 00:00:21,533
Rule three. Never hide a sickness
inside the wall. One hidden cough can
empty a whole city.

5
00:00:22,233 --> 00:00:28,233
You told the truth. That's rare. Good
news: we have a pharmacy. Bad news: an
inhaler costs thirty tokens.

6
00:00:28,933 --> 00:00:32,433
Thirty tokens. I own one token, and
it's my gate number.

7
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:37,300
Then you work. Everybody works.
Welcome home, whether you like it or
not.
